    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/f8664cdce5452ee7c8cb1d83bde4d1bb.avif?t=1753343934\" width=472 height=84 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>What's Inside?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>9\u00a0Different biomes </strong><br>-\u00a0<strong>100+\u00a0</strong>Levels to explore<strong> </strong><br><strong>- 6 game changing\u00a0</strong>powerups to unlock<strong>  </strong><br><strong>- 11\u00a0</strong>eggs to hunt<strong> </strong><br><strong>- 8\u00a0</strong>discoverable teleport combinations<strong> </strong><br><strong>- Dozens </strong>of traps<strong> </strong><br><strong>-\u00a0Hundreds</strong> of challenging jumps<strong>  </strong><br><strong>- 3-5+ </strong>hours of content</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Platforming:\u00a0</strong>Master tight controls and execute pixel-perfect jumps to navigate through perilous gauntlets of spikes, saw blades, collapsing platforms and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/0b64da3e4faf3b659da1c73a89386c90.poster.avif?t=1753343934\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/0b64da3e4faf3b659da1c73a89386c90.webm?t=1753343934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/0b64da3e4faf3b659da1c73a89386c90.mp4?t=1753343934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Biomes:\u00a0</strong>Explore\u00a0hand crafted levels, each with its own unique challenges, hazards, and atmospheric designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/b34da3513122a9cd46fe6bc2647d657b.poster.avif?t=1753343934\" width=400 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/b34da3513122a9cd46fe6bc2647d657b.webm?t=1753343934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/b34da3513122a9cd46fe6bc2647d657b.mp4?t=1753343934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles:\u00a0</strong>Outsmart intricate traps and solve environmental puzzles to uncover new paths and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/bf6451af41bc0014c46ba520d8c856f4.poster.avif?t=1753343934\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/bf6451af41bc0014c46ba520d8c856f4.webm?t=1753343934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/bf6451af41bc0014c46ba520d8c856f4.mp4?t=1753343934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Progression:\u00a0</strong>Each new area ramps up the difficulty, requiring you to perfect your timing and reflexes to advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/d7e2cfc4fd9f7f2b17969021fb9998ab.poster.avif?t=1753343934\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/d7e2cfc4fd9f7f2b17969021fb9998ab.webm?t=1753343934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/d7e2cfc4fd9f7f2b17969021fb9998ab.mp4?t=1753343934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power ups:\u00a0</strong>Unlock powerful abilities to expand your movement and open up new possibilities and areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/7cad9728b2b423e05c062ad1ab859c4d.poster.avif?t=1753343934\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/7cad9728b2b423e05c062ad1ab859c4d.webm?t=1753343934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/7cad9728b2b423e05c062ad1ab859c4d.mp4?t=1753343934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eggs!:\u00a0</strong>Find and collect hidden Eggs scattered throughout the levels, adding an extra layer of challenge for completionists. Each egg unlocks something different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/089e65f5695cd6eda8ec18e18a083d1a.avif?t=1753343934\" width=600 height=125 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has full\u00a0<strong>controller</strong> and\u00a0<strong>keyboard</strong> support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367480/extras/5ae49c58310e142149599a2bb7937a28.avif?t=1753343934\" width=500 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
